OL,3,GNEWSATax will not go above government  
OL,4,Alimit - council                        
OL,6,FA council has said it will not be      
OL,7,Fasking for an increase to council tax  
OL,8,Fby more than the 4.99% allowed by      
OL,9,Fgovernment despite it facing serious   
OL,10,Ffinancial problems.                    
OL,12,FSomerset Council needs to take "urgent 
OL,13,Faction" to prevent it from effectively 
OL,14,Fgoing bankrupt after its budget gap for
OL,15,F2027/28 rose to #71.3m, its own finance
OL,16,Fboss has said.                         
OL,18,FHowever, deputy leader of Somerset     
OL,19,FCouncil Liz Leyshon told BBC Radio     
OL,20,FSomerset that the council was not      
OL,21,Fasking government to increase council  
OL,22,Ftax by more than the statutory 4.99%.  
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
